      "text": "Multiple Qwen accounts are rotated round-robin with automatic failover, health-weighted load balancing, rate-limit tracking, and a configurable cooldown (default 2 minutes via RATE_LIMIT_COOLDOWN_MS); sessions are pooled, reused, auto-scaled, and idle-cleaned."
